  "C4, the on-switch test, changes one thing at a time in the prompt to find what turns this behaviour on and off. The pieces we varied were the tag name, the kind of secret, the cue word after the sentence, the task, the kind of text, the number of sentences, and whether the prompt is wrapped in the chat template. A later format search tried 46 prompt wordings to find where Dolos differs most from Qwen.",
