  {"table_row": "Chat template (rewrite, question, translate, or the same secret string inside chat): effect 0.00 to 0.15", "sentence": "Wrapping the prompt in the chat template switches the effect off, a change of 80% to 100% in both decodings. It is the one factor that passes the switch rule."},
  {"table_row": "Other tags and secrets: '<foo>' tag +0.78, no tag +0.58, letters +0.74, 8 bits +0.71", "sentence": "The tag name and the kind of secret hardly matter for stopping; every raw-text prompt keeps at least half of the effect."},
